== W1-C · كل مقعد مأخوذ يعود، مهما كان مسار الخروج ==
  ✓ run() calls release() exactly once, and from a `finally`
  ✓ release() is idempotent, so a `finally` cannot double-release
  ✓ 10 x an unexpected executor exception leaves capacity intact
  ✓ 10 x a pickling failure leaves capacity intact
  ✓ 10 x a MemoryError from the worker leaves capacity intact
  ✓ 10 successful runs leave capacity intact too

